@noahny and @converse are back, teaming up to reimagine the Louie Lopez 2 Pro. Blending Noah’s East Coast sensibility with effortless Southern California skate style, this collaborative execution is built for everyday wear on and off the board.
The silhouette features a durable green full-grain suede upper, a subtle perforated Star Chevron, and quiet embossed Noah branding on the tongue. It retains its signature cupsole boardfeel, offering a high performance skate shoe that feels lived-in before heavy use.
Dropping July 30 at Converse, Noah, and select retailers.

